          "title": "You'll want to know: хохотать",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "хохотать (khokhotát) — \"to roar with laughter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Мы хохотали весь вечер. My khokhotáli ves vécher. We roared with laughter all evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; present хохочу, хохочешь (т becomes ч). Perfective захохотать — to burst out laughing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "хохотать (khokhotát) is inherited from Proto-Slavic xoxotati (EtymDB), an imitative word built on the sound of loud laughter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
